{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112149","id":2958633042,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6wWShS","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112149","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112149.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112149.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112149","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112149/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112149/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112149/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ea9a2c3b2cd0703e7586f0c124b7e99af10fab1c","number":112149,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add CSV translation template generation","user":{"login":"timothyqiu","id":372476,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjQ3Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/372476?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu","html_url":"https://github.com/timothyqiu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Follow-up to #112073\r\n\r\nThis PR adds the ability to generate a CSV file as the translation template (equivalent to POT). Example CSV file generated:\r\n\r\n| key                 | ?context | ?plural   | _comments    | _locations                      |\r\n|---------------------|----------|-----------|--------------|---------------------------------|\r\n| Hello from GDScript |          |           | Hello world! | res://demo.gd:6 <br/> res://demo.gd:9 |\r\n| Letter              | Alphabet |           |              | res://demo.gd:7                 |\r\n| Letter              | Message  |           |              | res://demo.gd:8                 |\r\n| %d apple            |          | %d apples |              | res://demo.gd:10                |\r\n| Hello from Label    |          |           |              | res://demo.tscn                 |\r\n| All Recognized      |          |           |              |                                 |\r\n| New Code Region     |          |           |              |                                 |\r\n\r\n*A column won't be generated if there is nothing inside.\r\n\r\n<details><summary>template.csv</summary>\r\n\r\n```csv\r\nkey,?context,?plural,_comments,_locations\r\nHello from GDScript,,,Hello world!,\"res://demo.gd:6\r\nres://demo.gd:9\"\r\nLetter,Alphabet,,,res://demo.gd:7\r\nLetter,Message,,,res://demo.gd:8\r\n%d apple,,%d apples,,res://demo.gd:10\r\nHello from Label,,,,res://demo.tscn\r\nAll Recognized,,,,\r\nNew Code Region,,,,\r\n```\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n\r\nIn this PR:\r\n\r\n- POT related strings are replace with a neutrual one like \"template\".\r\n   - `POTGenerator` is renamed to `TranslationTemplateGenerator`, so are its filenames.\r\n   - The `POT Generation` tab in project settings dialog is now `Template Generation`.\r\n   - Variable names and strings are also replaced. But names of internal project settings are kept as-is for compatibility.\r\n- Since the generated CSV file only contains metadata, the current CSV importer errors about CSV missing translation columns. This PR changes it to a less scary warning.\r\n- Allow generating template files when only Add Built-in Strings is enabled. Supersedes #110858","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8133949121,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB5NI2wQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:i18n","name":"topic:i18n","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}